                            	  7984: UpdateGanon_JumpTable:
02:0003BA66 0003BA72        	  7985:     dc.l    Ganon_ScenePhase0   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
02:0003BA6A 0003BAD4        	  7986:     dc.l    Ganon_ScenePhase1   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
