02:0003E661 DE
02:0003E662 21
02:0003E663 F1
                            	  3811: 
                            	  3812: ; Player coordinate must be >= these bounds.
                            	  3813: ; Using these bounds; the player will be considered within the
                            	  3814: ; bounds of a doorway, if strictly inside except for 1 or 2 pixels
                            	  3815: ; at the edge.
